From a3d5b06cc5b3409621feb7c9afb16e327346832d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 06:56:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] SessionManager: group and colour tabs, show the list from
 the window edge

Tabs opened from the list are grouped by computer with this one first and
coloured per group, and a tab moved by hand stays where it was put. The list
also slides over the terminal when the pointer reaches the edge away from the
scroll bar, without resizing the terminal. New Running Terminal makes a tmux
session, or a screen one where tmux is missing.
